== four groups, 200000 rows owned by each of three regions ==
   us-east: primary us-east-a
   us-west: primary us-west-a
   ap-south: primary ap-south-a
   eu-west: primary eu-west-a
   every one of the four primaries holds 600000 rows, 6 s after the bulk insert
   size of the table: 75 MB
== ap-southeast joins ==
   ap-southeast: primary ap-southeast-a
   the new group is up 10 s later
   first copy done 2 s after the subscription: ap-southeast holds 601742 rows
   most WAL any logical slot on the ap-south primary kept during the copy: 1 MB
