   converged 2 s after the pause
   rows owned by us-east: acknowledged 201241; held by us-east=201241 us-west=201241 ap-south=201241 ap-southeast=201241 eu-west=201241
   rows owned by us-west: acknowledged 201238; held by us-east=201238 us-west=201238 ap-south=201238 ap-southeast=201238 eu-west=201238
   rows owned by ap-south: acknowledged 201250; held by us-east=201250 us-west=201250 ap-south=201250 ap-southeast=201250 eu-west=201250
   rows owned by ap-southeast: acknowledged 655; held by us-east=655 us-west=655 ap-south=655 ap-southeast=655 eu-west=655
